#. translators: 1: opening link to the bug report, 2: closing link
#, php-format
msgid "The outlets did not load, so they cannot be edited or saved here right now. Your saved outlets and their price lists have not changed. Refresh the page. If this message comes back, %1$stell us%2$s."
msgstr "Prodajna mjesta nisu se učitala, pa ih ovdje sada ne možete uređivati ni spremati. Spremljena mjesta i njihovi cjenici nisu promijenjeni. Osvježite stranicu. Ako se poruka ponovi, %1$sjavite nam%2$s."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:87
#. translators: %s: the heading of the section with the manual items ("Additional items" or "Products")
#, php-format
msgid "The Pravilnik (NN 132/2026-1584) requires a price list for each outlet. The webshop is the first outlet. If you also sell elsewhere, for example in a shop, add that outlet below. Each outlet has its own public price list at a permanent address and its own archive: a price list stays public for 15 days after a newer one replaces it, as the Pravilnik requires. Assign manual items (services, shipping) to an outlet with the choice above the table in %s. Removing an outlet also deletes its manual items, and the archive of its price lists stays."
msgstr "Pravilnik (NN 132/2026-1584) traži cjenik za svako prodajno mjesto. Webshop je prvo prodajno mjesto. Ako prodajete i drugdje, npr. u prodavaonici, to mjesto dodajte ispod. Svako mjesto ima svoj javni cjenik na stalnoj adresi i svoju arhivu: cjenik ostaje javan 15 dana nakon što ga zamijeni noviji, kako traži Pravilnik. Ručne stavke (usluge, dostava) mjestu dodjeljujete izborom iznad tablice u odjeljku %s. Kad uklonite prodajno mjesto, brišu se i njegove ručne stavke, a arhiva njegovih cjenika ostaje."

