#: includes/admin/tab-settings.php:384
msgid "Another plugin shows the lowest price in 30 days, so this choice does not change what customers see. It applies once that plugin is turned off."
msgstr "Najnižu cijenu u 30 dana prikazuje drugi dodatak, pa ovaj izbor ne mijenja što kupci vide. Vrijedi kad se taj dodatak isključi."

#: includes/admin/tab-settings.php:386
msgid "When this is off, products on sale show the struck regular price and the sale price, without the line with the lowest price in the 30 days before the discount. The law requires the lowest price in 30 days while a sale, a clearance sale or another reduction lasts, so turn this off only if you show it another way. The price history is recorded either way."
msgstr "Kad je ovo isključeno, proizvodi na akciji pokazuju precrtanu redovnu i akcijsku cijenu, bez retka s najnižom cijenom u 30 dana prije sniženja. Zakon traži najnižu cijenu u 30 dana dok traje akcija, rasprodaja ili drugo sniženje, pa ovo isključite samo ako je prikazujete na drugi način. Povijest cijena bilježi se i tada."

