msgstr "Omogući mjernu jedinicu uz baznu cijenu"

#: includes/admin/tab-settings.php:419
msgid "When this is on, the unit price (CJM) appears next to the bazna cijena: on the Woo product and variation, and on every row of the Products or Additional items tab. Turn it on for the row and enter a suffix (e.g. \"za kg/l\"), and the shop shows \"Cijena za kg/l (10.09.2026.)\". The same unit of measure goes into the public XML/CSV and the HTML table."
msgstr "Kad je uključeno, uz baznu cijenu pojavljuje se CJM: na Woo proizvodu i varijaciji, i na svakom retku kartice Proizvodi ili Dodatne stavke. Uključite ga na retku i upišite nastavak (npr. \"za kg/l\") pa se prikazuje \"Cijena za kg/l (10.09.2026.)\". Ista mjerna jedinica ide u javni XML/CSV i u HTML tablicu."

#: includes/admin/tab-settings.php:427
msgid "No taxonomy"
msgstr "Bez taksonomije"

#: includes/admin/tab-settings.php:432
msgid "For WooCommerce products, the brand in the price list is the name of the term from the selected taxonomy (e.g. product_brand or pa_marka). A variation without a term takes the parent's brand."
msgstr "Za WooCommerce proizvode marka u cjeniku je naziv pojma iz odabrane taksonomije (npr. product_brand ili pa_marka). Varijacija bez pojma uzima marku roditelja."

#: includes/admin/tab-settings.php:434
