msgstr "Ovaj uvoz više nije u tijeku. Kako je završio, vidite u Povijesti."

#: includes/class-migration.php:160
#. translators: 1: number of settings, 2: number of files, 3: plugin names or "nothing"
#, php-format
msgid "CX Sidrena has taken over the settings (%1$d) and the price list and archive files (%2$d) from the MJDD Sidrena i bazna cijena plugin. Bazna cijena values, dates and price history on products stay as they are. Switched off: %3$s."
msgstr "CX Sidrena je preuzela postavke (%1$d) i datoteke cjenika i arhive (%2$d) iz plugina MJDD Sidrena i bazna cijena. Bazne cijene, datumi i povijest cijena na proizvodima ostaju kakvi jesu. Isključeno: %3$s."

#: includes/class-migration.php:163
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "ništa"

#: includes/class-migration.php:171
#. translators: %s: plugin names
#, php-format
msgid "Switched off: %s. CX Sidrena does the same, and two such plugins switched on together would show prices twice."
msgstr "Isključeno: %s. CX Sidrena radi isto, a dva takva plugina uključena zajedno prikazala bi cijene dvaput."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:85
msgid "While the sale price is active, the public price list writes “akcija”. Enter another name here (e.g. rasprodaja, sezonsko sniženje) if needed. An empty field means “akcija”. Without an active sale price nothing is published."
msgstr "Dok je akcijska cijena aktivna, javni cjenik upisuje akcija. Ovdje upišite drugi naziv (rasprodaja, sezonsko sniženje) ako treba. Prazno polje znači akcija. Bez aktivne akcijske cijene se ne objavljuje."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:106
msgid "Unit in the public price list, e.g. kg, l, or pcs. Empty if the product has no unit price."
msgstr "Jedinica u javnom cjeniku, npr. kg, l ili kom. Prazno ako proizvod nema cijenu za jedinicu mjere."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:118
msgid "Same format as the regular price. Published alongside the retail price. Empty if not applicable."
msgstr "Isti oblik kao redovna cijena. Objavljuje se uz maloprodajnu cijenu. Prazno ako nije primjenjivo."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:126
#: includes/class-product-fields.php:453
msgid "Not used while Net quantity is filled in. Kept, and used again if you clear Net quantity."
msgstr "Ne koristi se dok je upisana neto količina. Ostaje spremljeno i ponovno vrijedi ako neto količinu obrišete."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:176
msgid "A price per kg or l is required for food and animal feed, detergents, paints and varnishes (not artists' paints), oils and fluids for engines and motor vehicles, distilled water, and products for the care, washing and cleaning of face, body, hair, teeth and mouth."
msgstr "Cijenu za kg ili l moraju imati hrana i hrana za životinje, deterdženti, boje i lakovi (osim slikarskih), ulja i tekućine za motore i motorna vozila, destilirana voda te proizvodi za njegu, pranje i čišćenje lica, tijela, kose, zubi i usne šupljine."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:177
msgid "For food in a liquid, enter the drained weight. For glazed food, enter the weight without the glaze."
msgstr "Za hranu u tekućini upišite ocijeđenu masu, a za glaziranu hranu masu bez glazure."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:178
msgid "Leave it empty for gift packs and sets, pet treats, cakes, alcoholic drinks up to 100 ml, frozen desserts up to 500 ml, and fruit and vegetables sold by the piece or by the bunch."
msgstr "Ostavite prazno za poklon pakete i komplete, poslastice za kućne ljubimce, kolače, alkoholna pića do 100 ml, smrznute deserte do 500 ml te voće i povrće na komad ili u svežnju."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:179
msgid "Under 50 g or 50 ml, or when the price per kg or l equals the product's price, the product page does not show it. The price list still has it."
msgstr "Ispod 50 g ili 50 ml, ili kad je cijena za kg ili l jednaka cijeni proizvoda, stranica proizvoda je ne prikazuje. U cjeniku ostaje."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:182
msgid "The new unit price shows after you save."
msgstr "Nova cijena za jedinicu mjere vidi se nakon spremanja."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:186
msgid "Unit of the net quantity"
msgstr "Jedinica neto količine"

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:193
msgid "For goods that must show a price per kg or l. Leave it empty for anything else."
msgstr "Za robu koja mora imati cijenu za kg ili l. Za ostalo ostavite prazno."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:195
msgid "Which goods, and when to leave it empty"
msgstr "Koja roba i kada ostaviti prazno"

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:226
msgid "The unit price is worked out once the product has a price."
msgstr "Cijena za jedinicu mjere izračunat će se kad proizvod dobije cijenu."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:232
#, php-format
msgid "Unit price: %s. Shown on the product page and in the price list."
msgstr "Cijena za jedinicu mjere: %s. Prikazuje se na stranici proizvoda i u cjeniku."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:235
#, php-format
msgid "Unit price: %s, in the price list only. The product page does not show it under 50 g or 50 ml."
msgstr "Cijena za jedinicu mjere: %s, samo u cjeniku. Ispod 50 g ili 50 ml stranica proizvoda je ne prikazuje."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:238
#, php-format
msgid "Unit price: %s, in the price list only. It equals the product's price, so the product page does not show it."
msgstr "Cijena za jedinicu mjere: %s, samo u cjeniku. Jednaka je cijeni proizvoda pa je stranica proizvoda ne prikazuje."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:242
msgid "During the sale it is worked out from the sale price."
msgstr "Dok traje akcija, računa se iz akcijske cijene."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:277
#. translators: %1$s: the "N+M gratis" text as it is in the name, e.g. 1+1 Gratis. %2$s: number of pieces, e.g. 2. %3$s: net quantity of one piece, e.g. 50 ml. %4$s: the whole pack, e.g. 100 ml.
#, php-format
msgid "The name has “%1$s”, so it is worked out for the whole pack: %2$s × %3$s = %4$s. Enter the net quantity of one piece, as on its label."
msgstr "U nazivu je „%1$s” pa se računa za cijelo pakiranje: %2$s × %3$s = %4$s. Neto količinu upišite za jedan komad, kao na naljepnici."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:315
msgid "No bazna cijena yet. It will be set from the regular price when you save."
msgstr "Još nema bazne cijene. Postavit će se iz redovne cijene kad spremite."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:319
msgid "No bazna cijena. It is listed on Status under Needs attention."
msgstr "Nema bazne cijene. Navedena je na kartici Stanje, pod Treba pozornost."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:334
msgid "Change"
msgstr "Promijeni"

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:346
#, php-format
msgid "Empty: the date by the rule (%s)."
msgstr "Prazno: datum po pravilu (%s)."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:349
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Razlog"

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:351
msgid "Optional. Kept in the price history."
msgstr "Neobavezno. Ostaje u povijesti cijena."

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:394
msgid "Appended to the prefix: Price per kg/l"
msgstr "Dodaje se u prefix: Cijena za kg/l"

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:429
msgid "Prefix CJM suffix"
msgstr "CJM dodatak prefixu"

#: includes/class-product-fields.php:493
msgid "Tick this if the product is a service (e.g. fitting, repair). It then goes into the services price list, not the goods price list."
msgstr "Označite ako je proizvod usluga (npr. montaža, servis). Tada ide u cjenik usluga, a ne u cjenik robe."

#: includes/class-sale-rule.php:155
#. translators: %s: date of the bazna cijena
#, php-format
msgid "Suggested from today's sale and prices: in your own records, check the sale and price on %s"
msgstr "Prijedlog iz današnje akcije i cijena: u svojoj evidenciji provjerite akciju i cijenu na dan %s"

#: includes/class-sale-rule.php:160
#. translators: %s: date of the bazna cijena
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the lowest price in the 30 days before the sale"
msgstr "%s: najniža cijena u 30 dana prije akcije"

#: includes/class-sale-rule.php:164
#. translators: %s: date of the bazna cijena
#, php-format
msgid "%s: the regular price before the sale"
msgstr "%s: redovna cijena prije akcije"

#: includes/class-sale-rule.php:167
#. translators: %s: date of the bazna cijena
#, php-format
msgid "%s: no rule for this date, enter the bazna cijena"
msgstr "%s: za ovaj datum nema pravila, upišite baznu cijenu"

#: includes/class-settings.php:397
#. translators: %s: name of the place of sale
#, php-format
msgid "Not saved: the same price list for all places of sale is turned on, so %s can't have items of its own. To give it its own prices, turn that off in Settings, under Places of sale."
msgstr "Nije spremljeno: uključen je isti cjenik za sva prodajna mjesta, pa mjesto %s ne može imati svoje stavke. Ako mu želite dati vlastite cijene, to isključite u Postavkama, pod Prodajna mjesta."

#: includes/class-updates.php:111
msgid "manual: automatic updates are turned off by the CX_SIDRENA_AUTO_UPDATE constant in wp-config.php"
msgstr "ručno: automatsko ažuriranje isključeno je konstantom CX_SIDRENA_AUTO_UPDATE u wp-config.php"

#: includes/class-updates.php:114
msgid "manual: automatic updates are turned off for the whole site (by the hosting or in wp-config.php)"
msgstr "ručno: automatska ažuriranja isključena su za cijelu stranicu (na hostingu ili u wp-config.php)"

#: includes/class-updates.php:117
msgid "automatic, from the releases on GitHub (cx-core/cx-sidrena)"
msgstr "automatski, iz izdanja na GitHubu (cx-core/cx-sidrena)"

